<title>USA: Old Guard sets initial semi-annual dividend.</title>
<headline>Old Guard sets initial semi-annual dividend.</headline>
<dateline>LANCASTER, Pa. 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Old Guard Group Inc said Tuesday its board declared an initial semiannual dividend of $0.05 per share on its outstanding shares of common stock, payable September 16 to shareholders of record on September 2.</p>
<p>The company said this marks its first semiannual dividend since its conversion from a mutual to a publicly traded stock company in February.</p>
